** Trusted Research Environment (TRE)

A [[color:hotpink][Trusted Research Environment (TRE)]] is a highly secure digital platform that allows [[color:cyan][approved researchers]] to access and analyse [[color:yellow][sensitive data]] without the data ever leaving the secure environment.

TREs are becoming increasingly popular in research due to:

#+ATTR_REVEAL: :frag (appear)
- [[color:lime][compliance requirements]] from funders & regulators
- increased [[color:yellow][cyber security threat landscape]]
- increased use of [[color:aqua][sensitive data]] in research

https://docs.er.kcl.ac.uk/CREATE/TRE/tre/

