** Research Software Engineering (RSE)

The [[color:lime][Research Software Engineering]] team can develop the software required to enable and facilitate your research.

The team have a wide range of experience and skills developing code for a [[color:orange][range of academic disciplines.]]

Support is provided by:

#+ATTR_REVEAL: :frag (appear) :align left
- [[color:fuchsia][consultation and advice]]
- being [[color:yellow][costed into grants]] for [[color:cya][hands-on]] dev work

** Project design and co-writing

The e-Research team can assist with [[color:orange][project design]] and [[color:deeppink][co-writing]] (for projects with computational-, data-science or sensitive data components)

We act as [[color:deepskyblue][Co-Investigators]] where required.

We have a comprehensive [[color:gold][Costing Model]] for inclusion of costs in grants.

