** Organisational/budget structure

e-Research sits in the [[color:deeppink][Research Management and Innovation Directorate]] (RMID) in Professional Services (PS).

#+ATTR_REVEAL: :frag (appear)
We have a staff budget, and an annual capital budget for minor maintenance/hardware upgrades (from the /Research Infrastructure Fund/).

#+ATTR_REVEAL: :frag (appear)
All software/licenses/warranties are paid through [[color:lavender][income from research grants]]

